OL,3,GNEWSAMural honours the forgotten force
OL,4,Abehind The Beatles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural celebrating a musician who has
OL,7,Fbeen described as the "forgotten sixth
OL,8,FBeatle" is set to be unveiled later by
OL,9,Fthe community he helped to shape.
OL,11,FThe artwork in Liverpool's Toxteth area
OL,12,Fhonours Lord Woodbine, a mentor to The
OL,13,FBeatles and an icon of the city's
OL,14,FCaribbean community.
OL,16,FThe Trinidadian calypsonian, steelpan
OL,17,Fplayer and promoter became an
OL,18,Finfluential figure in Liverpool's
OL,19,FCaribbean music scene and played a role
OL,20,Fin the Fab Four's early years.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
