OL,3,GNEWSAMural honours the forgotten force
OL,4,Abehind The Beatles
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis daughter Carol Phillips said: "We
OL,7,Fhope it [the mural] will be a catalyst
OL,8,Ffor the celebration and visibility of
OL,9,Fthe Liverpool 8 [district] music scene
OL,10,Fand the contributions musicians like my
OL,11,FDad made."
